# Practice Reading Tests

## Entry
- Home → Practice Reading → **catalog of 3 tests** (open any ready test)
- Catalog: `practiceReadingCatalog.ts`

## Modes (inside a test)
- **Learn** — Lead-in → Task advice (if any) → tasks → Vocab / Learn-pack
- **Exam** — scored tasks подряд → **Done → combined results** → next test

## Shell
- Hub: `PracticeReadingHub` (catalog → modes → session → results)
- Results: `PracticeReadingResults`
- Exam: `PracticeReadingExam` reports score via `onFinish`
- Data: `practiceReadingTest1.ts`, `practiceReadingTest2.ts`, `practiceReadingTest3.ts`

## Layout (locked — reuse for all practice exam engines)
- Split **Reading | Questions** = **equal columns** (`1fr 1fr`)
- No internal scrollbar on the questions panel — content must fit the viewport
- Questions panel fills height: stems + option bank use `flex` / `space-evenly` (not stuck to the top with empty void below)
- Readable type (~0.86–0.92rem stems); do not shrink text to “fit” by making it tiny
- Passage may scroll if long; questions side should not need a scrollbar for 6 items
- After Check: evidence highlight in passage; tip as one bottom strip (not expanding every row)
- CSS hooks: `.pr-exam__split:has(.pr-task-box--tfng|endings|completion)`, `.pr-endings-panel`, `.pr-task-box--endings`

## Engines (reuse for same task types)
### True / False / Not Given (`type: "tfng"`)
- One row: **num | statement | TRUE · FALSE · NG** (choices on the right)
- Compact legend: `TRUE · FALSE · NOT GIVEN`
- Component: `TfngExam` in `PracticeReadingExam.tsx`

### Matching headings (`type: "matching-headings"`)
- Passage left | List of Headings right with paragraph select (A–F) on each row
- Example heading locked (e.g. iv → G)
- Component: `MatchingExam` in `PracticeReadingExam.tsx`

### Matching sentence endings (`type: "sentence-endings"`) — canonical engine
- Passage left | stems with ending select (A–H) + endings bank (2-col) below
- Each letter used at most once; used bank items dimmed
- Short one-line instruction under “Questions 1–6”
- Component: `EndingsExam` in `PracticeReadingExam.tsx`
- **Reuse this pattern** for future tests with the same task type

### Sentence completion (`type: "sentence-completion"`)
- Passage left | stems with inline blank (NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS)
- Accept list + normalized match (trim / case / spaces)
- Same equal-column layout as endings
- Component: `CompletionExam` in `PracticeReadingExam.tsx`

### Matching information (`type: "matching-information"`)
- Passage left | statements + paragraph select A–F
- `allowReuse: true` → letters may repeat (IELTS NB)
- Optional `training` synonyms → `PracticeReadingSuggestedFill`
- Component: `MatchingInfoExam` in `PracticeReadingExam.tsx`

### Summary completion (`type: "summary-completion"`)
- Continuous summary with `{{7}}` blank markers · ONE WORD ONLY
- Component: `SummaryExam` in `PracticeReadingExam.tsx`

### Learn pack (`type: "learn-pack"`)
- Language → optional Vocabulary → Follow-up speak
- Component: `PracticeReadingLearnPack.tsx`

### Pronoun reference (Language with passage) — reuse engine
- Trigger: language items use `prompt` (+ optional `paragraphId`)
- Layout: **Reading | Language** equal columns (`1fr 1fr`) — same as exam engines
- Bold pronouns in `**it**` / `**They**`; student types what they refer to
- Hover/focus item → highlight that paragraph in the passage
- After Check: show key; flexible `accept[]`
- Do **not** show language-only full-width without passage for this task type

## Stats
- Exam Done → `savePracticeAttempt` → `localStorage` (`practiceStats.ts`)
- Home progress opens `StatsPage`

## Content
- **Do not change textbook wording** from user scans
- Official keys from teacher book when provided
